  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nyahava paprika capacity building grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to train staff in good governance practices; purchase accounting software; train farmers in improved horticultural practices and the farming business; establish a bulking station for storage; develop accounting and human resource policy manuals; hire a full-time field officer to provide technical assistance to farmers; purchase a motorcycle and bicycles for provision of extension services; and purchase office equipment.</narrative>
  </description>
